# Telos, Atris's secret academy (TSL, 262TEL, to the Ebon Hawk, 003EBO):
# the Handmaidens' welcome (weapons laid down: LSP), Kreia's mind on
# Atton, Atris's judgement on DSimpson's Light Path (the Persuade check
# failed with this Exile's ranks, still the Light Path), the cells: Kreia,
# Bao-Dur raised as they open (LSP, +INF; he comes along: the party
# Bao-Dur and Kreia), T3-M4 in his force cage (LSP, +INF), the loading
# ramp; aboard, the Handmaidens with Atris, T3's holo of the Exile's
# trial and the Jedi Masters' whereabouts, and the Handmaiden joining
# (+INF twice). Ends on the Ebon Hawk, the galaxy map next (Dantooine).
# Starts from the polar plateau's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_academy data/routes/tsl/telos_academy.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "Telos - Hidden Base" and "The Ebon Hawk"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
say All right - we mean no harm # the Handmaidens: weapons down (LSP)
talk
talk                 # Kreia and Atton in the cell
say Tell me what you've done with my friends first # Atris, the Light Path
say It was not my intention to come here, Atris
say I'm not here to debate the Council's decision
say I am looking for my ship so I can leave Telos
say =The destruction of Peragus was an accident.
say Why don't you tell me?
say Why is Telos so important?
say But the Sith attacked me on Peragus - the battle destroyed the colony
say The Sith came for me on Peragus, to kill me
say I don't know. Perhaps they were
say If so, then I offer you my help
say I am not doing this out of fear # the Persuade check, failed
say Where can I find my companions?
say Then I'll be going now.
talk
say The woman here is a Jedi, Atris, one of the Council # Kreia at the cell
say Look, we need to leave, so let's go # door
say Is Atton okay?
say He can sleep on the ship. Let's go
use PrisonDoor
talk
say There is nothing to apologize for # Bao-Dur up as the cells open (LSP,
say A Jedi academy - concealed on the northern pole of Telos # +INF)
say Are you well enough to travel?
say Come with me, then. I could use your help
talk
party 1,6            # Bao-Dur and Kreia; Atton sleeps it off aboard
say It wasn't your fault they took the ship # T3-M4 in his force cage (LSP,
to T3Enter           # +INF)
talk
say Enter the Ebon Hawk # the loading ramp
to tr_setup_ebo
talk
say I will take whatever help I can get # aboard: the Handmaiden joins
say Look, forget Atton. Take the regular quarters # (+INF twice)
module 003ebo
save telos_done
